  "content.how_do_customer_sms_notifications_work_in_tanzania": "Arifa za SMS kwa wateja zinafanyaje kazi Tanzania?",
  "content.lumo_track_integrates_with_local_telecom_networks_in_tanzania_vodacom_tigo_airtel_halotel_": "LUMO Track inaunganishwa na mitandao ya Tanzania (Vodacom, Tigo, Airtel, Halotel). Oda ikisajiliwa au hali ikibadilika, SMS hutumwa kwa mteja kiotomatiki.",
