  "content.merchant_registers_order_in_the_lumo_dashboard_with_customer_phone_number_delivery_destina": "Mfanyabiashara anasajili oda kwenye dashibodi ya LUMO kwa simu ya mteja, anwani na dereva.",
  "content.system_dispatches_automated_sms_whatsapp_message_containing_the_customer_s_unique_secure_w": "Mfumo hutuma SMS au WhatsApp yenye kiungo salama cha kipekee cha kufuatilia mzigo.",
  "content.driver_opens_browser_action_link_on_their_phone_and_taps_start_delivery_updating_order_sta": "Dereva hufungua kiungo kwenye simu na kubonyeza Anza safari, hivyo hali inakuwa Njiani.",
